    group ungrouped
    topic "removalDescription"
    p "Section 81, R.S. § 5256; Nov. 6, 1978, " ["Pub. L. 95–598, title III, § 322(g)" -> "/us/pl/95/598/tIII/s322/g"] ", " ["92 Stat. 2679" -> "/us/stat/92/2679"] ", related to Union Pacific Railroad Company, its books, records, correspondence, other documents, dividends, stock issuance, mortgages or pledges, and directors or officers."
