  note "/us/usc/t45/s81...92/note/ungrouped/nolaw/h.f5716f67d30b9cb9" editorial {
    group ungrouped
    topic "removalDescription"
    p "Section 82, R.S. § 5257, provided for connection of other roads with Union Pacific Railroad or any of its branches."
