    p "Section 91, " ["act Mar. 3, 1897, ch. 386" -> "/us/act/1897-03-03/ch386"] ", " ["29 Stat. 663" -> "/us/stat/29/663"] ", provided that provisions of " ["section 90 of this title" -> "/us/usc/t45/s90"] " were extended and made applicable to Navy and Marine Corps transportation."
    hash "c9dfbbb8347ff7b443ce6c9e329cbdf9085c444f1f5b0c150abc089816ca1e8a"
